sessionalHymnAfterOde3.text:
The sacred Joachim and Anna offered a gift to the priests of old, but it was not accepted, for they were barren;
but they made entreaty to the Giver of all things, and, hearkening to their prayer,//
He granteth them the Tree of Life, whose holy conception we honor.

ode6.irmos:
Emulating the Prophet Jonah, I cry aloud: Free Thou my life from corruption, O Good One;
and save me who crieth out://
O Savior of the world, Glory be to Thee!

ode9.irmos2:
A strange and most wondrous mystery do I see: the cave is heaven;
the Virgin the throne of the cherubim; the manger a room,//
in which Christ God, whom nothing can contain, is laid. Whom we praise and magnify.
